      <h2 id="virt-hot-plugging-memory_virt-edit-vms" class="group scroll-mt-20">Hot plugging memory on a virtual machine<a href="#virt-hot-plugging-memory_virt-edit-vms" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h2>
